<title>UK: Lai Sun sets $100 mln exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Lai Sun sets $100 mln exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust International Plc &amp; HSBC Investment Bank Asia Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAI SUN INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (CAYMAN ISLANDS)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LAI SUN DEVELOPEMENT CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    28.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p>NOTES  EACH BOND IS EXCHANGEABLE INTO ORDINARY SHARES OF ASIA TELEVISION LTD (ATV).</p>
<p>CONDITIONAL PUT OPTION AT 120.69, PUT OPTION 2 AT 125.45 CALLABLE ON OR AFTER IPO UNTIL 30 DAYS PRIOR TO MATURITY  </p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/SI</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  HK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGE PRICE AND SHARES PER BOND TO BE FIXED ON</p>
<p>		INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERING DATE</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
